==========================================================================
SEPARATING EXPERIMENT for check [4]'s n-uniform fact
==========================================================================
The identity sum(multiplicity x dimension) = B is ALREADY verified
exactly at n = 5..9.  It is a SATURATED INSTRUMENT for this question:
it passes whether or not the canonical bases are isotypic-adapted, so
no support for the fact may be read from it.  The separating
instrument is EXACT H-ORTHOGONALITY of distinct components, over Q.

A spectral screen was written, run, and WITHDRAWN: the canonical bases
are NOT orthonormal, so E^T H E is a CONGRUENCE and eigenvalues are
not preserved.  Its apparent refutation was an artefact.  Congruence
preserves INERTIA, vacuous on a positive definite example.  The
figures are MEASURED below rather than quoted here, so they cannot
drift from the prose.  See the docstring.
==========================================================================

